### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Registro (organizador)
POST {{host}}/sessions/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "first_name": "Laura", "last_name": "Gomez", "email": "laura@mail.com", "age": 33, "password": "123456", "role": "organizer" }

### 2. Registro (asistente)
POST {{host}}/sessions/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "first_name": "Pedro", "last_name": "Suarez", "email": "pedro@mail.com", "age": 25, "password": "123456" }

### 3. Login
POST {{host}}/sessions/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "pedro@mail.com", "password": "123456" }

### 4. Usuario actual (no debe incluir password)
GET {{host}}/sessions/current

### 5. Crear evento (requiere rol organizer)
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Node Day", "description": "Charlas de backend", "date": "2027-03-10T18:00:00.000Z", "location": "CABA", "capacity": 2, "price": 0 }

### 6. Publicar evento
POST {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/publish

### 7. Listar eventos publicados
GET {{host}}/events?limit=10&page=1

### 8. Inscribirse
POST {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/inscriptions

### 8b. Inscribirse (ruta alternativa)
POST {{host}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "<EVENT_ID>" }

### 9. Mis tickets (populate sin password)
GET {{host}}/tickets/mine

### 10. Cancelar inscripcion
PUT {{host}}/tickets/<TICKET_ID>/cancel

### 11. Inscriptos del evento (solo organizador)
GET {{host}}/events/<EVENT_ID>/tickets

### 12. Logout
POST {{host}}/sessions/logout
